                                                "text": "plashing among bedded pebbles"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb914a96-8626-4ee4-98e5-57cbecf8d515",
                                                "sense_id": "1b2e0a94-ef51-32a9-81bb-76f5991c494d",
                                                "text": "Far below him plashed the waters, / Plashed and washed the dreamy waters; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59755f51-f96b-4906-9624-53d24f55c5b5",
                                                "sense_id": "1b2e0a94-ef51-32a9-81bb-76f5991c494d",
                                                "text": "[…] heedless of my expostulations and the growling thunder, and the great drops that began to plash around her […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9212b862-5a93-3143-bbce-42a021bc2031",
